# N2 molecule in a box (D4h), 4x4x4 Gamma-centred k mesh: ground state with the irreducible BZ (nsym 16), expanded
# to the full BZ by the RDMFT driver; symmetry reduction of the RDMFT calculation.
# DS1: LDA ground state (irreducible BZ, WFK).
# DS2, DS3: RDMFT, all the functionals at the ground-state occupations, with (rdmft_sym_reduce 1) and without (0)
#   the symmetry reduction: same energies.
# DS4, DS5: RDMFT with GNOF and fixed orbitals, symmetric table with (1) and without (2) the symmetry reduction: same energy.
# DS6: as DS4 with rdmft_sym_unfold 1: the one-representative stars whose principal orbital cannot be coupled with a
#   k-independent virtual orbital are unfolded; the energy is the one of the full BZ (rdmft_sym_reduce 0).
ndtset 6

acell 3*4 angstrom
ntypat 1
znucl 7
natom 2
typat 1 1
xcart -0.55 0 0  0.55 0 0 angstrom
istwfk *1
pp_dirpath "$ABI_PSPDIR"
pseudos "Psdj_nc_sr_04_pw_std_psp8/N.psp8"

ecut 4
nband 10
kptopt 1
ngkpt 4 4 4
nshiftk 1
shiftk 0 0 0
prtwf 1
tolvrs 1e-12
nstep 60
ixc 11

optdriver2 11
ixc2 40
fock_icutcoul2 3
getwfk2 1
rdmft_selfint2 1
rdmft_functional2 0
rdmft_sym_reduce2 1

optdriver3 11
ixc3 40
fock_icutcoul3 3
getwfk3 1
rdmft_selfint3 1
rdmft_functional3 0
rdmft_sym_reduce3 0

optdriver4 11
ixc4 40
fock_icutcoul4 3
getwfk4 1
rdmft_selfint4 1
rdmft_functional4 24
rdmft_nocc_act4 1
rdmft_ncoupl4 2
rdmft_sym_reduce4 1

optdriver5 11
ixc5 40
fock_icutcoul5 3
getwfk5 1
rdmft_selfint5 1
rdmft_functional5 24
rdmft_nocc_act5 1
rdmft_ncoupl5 2
rdmft_sym_reduce5 2

optdriver6 11
ixc6 40
fock_icutcoul6 3
getwfk6 1
rdmft_selfint6 1
rdmft_functional6 24
rdmft_nocc_act6 1
rdmft_ncoupl6 2
rdmft_sym_reduce6 1
rdmft_sym_unfold6 1.0

