#%%   full BZ by the RDMFT driver (optdriver 11), and symmetry reduction of the integrals (rdmft_sym_reduce).
#%%   DS2/DS3: all the functionals at the ground-state occupations with and without the reduction (same energies);
#%%   DS4/DS5: GNOF with fixed orbitals and the symmetric table of subspaces, with and without the reduction (same energy).
#%%   DS6: as DS4 with rdmft_sym_unfold 1: the stars of the principal orbitals with a refused k-independent virtual orbital
#%%   are unfolded, the energy is the one of the full BZ (rdmft_sym_reduce 0).
#%%<END TEST_INFO>
